{"id": "DcwCCgivcIQ", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CODING\" to get these 4 plugins to level up your vibe coding.\n\nDon't start vibe coding with Claude Code unless you have installed these 4 plugins.\n\nFirst is Ponytail.\n\nIt optimizes your Claude Code's output.\n\nIt cuts your token usage by over 50% without losing any accuracy at all.\n\nSecond is OmniRoute.\n\nIt gives your Claude Code almost unlimited usage by connecting to over 300 free AI providers.\n\nThe moment your usage limit runs out, it automatically switches you to the next best model.\n\nGiving you up to 1.6 billion free tokens every single month.\n\nThird is Graphify.\n\nIt turns your entire codebase into a knowledge graph.\n\nSo your agent doesn't waste tokens by re-reading files again and again.\n\nAnd finally, Agent Skills.\n\nIt's a pack of 24 skills that let you vibe code like a senior engineer.\n\nBuilt by the former AI engineering director at Google.\n\nIt has dedicated skills for planning, coding, testing, and publishing.\n\nIt activates the right one at different stages of coding, all on its own.\n\n#claudecode #vibecoding #aicoding #omniroute #agentskills", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1788278200, "like_count": 18376, "comment_count": 13252, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1687939972275750a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.495, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN_vGDNJ86UQ8Myb_iao5MEBPb15DAJ9ITP8L5DabotizDDO_K0iYjxR1Vqd79FuBsYVr7UPXv2XqtKyalKQqIpyLnqtslIFlQFJ6A.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdpVwcDXBMHpH8RZy3TnriIO8wsok5lf7TIWp-xjLCYWtG4mKdVoOjrhaCgI77KB77Y&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=zMKeA9rSPGkQ7kNvwG__F5B&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=cI0SfhFC0RpeGOCkCBkV5g&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlg